WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.125 --> 00:00:06.765
PETER QUILL
We were gone for quite a while.

00:00:06.820 --> 00:00:08.793
♪♪

00:00:08.844 --> 00:00:10.828
But no matter
what happens next,

00:00:12.977 --> 00:00:14.781
the galaxy still
needs its Guardians.

00:00:16.725 --> 00:00:18.777
PETER QUILL
Hello! We come in peace.

00:00:21.758 --> 00:00:22.664
[Alien giggles]

00:00:25.188 --> 00:00:26.410
[Crowd gasps]

00:00:26.461 --> 00:00:28.349
PETER QUILL
Come on Drax, seriously dude?

00:00:28.400 --> 00:00:29.680
ALIEN
Nodu nada!

00:00:29.731 --> 00:00:30.317
PETER QUILL
Ow!

00:00:30.367 --> 00:00:32.716
DRAX
[Laughing] Hey!

00:00:32.766 --> 00:00:34.538
[Screaming]

00:00:34.588 --> 00:00:37.012
♫ "In The Meantime"
by Spacehog ♫

00:00:39.987 --> 00:00:41.150
MANTIS
Don't forget...

00:00:43.268 --> 00:00:44.737
...where we came from.

00:00:49.237 --> 00:00:50.509
PETER QUILL
We have been running...

00:00:51.729 --> 00:00:53.178
...our whole lives.

00:00:55.521 --> 00:00:58.141
ROCKET
Pete, I'm done running.

00:00:59.490 --> 00:01:03.380
♫ We love the all,
the all of you ♫

00:01:06.271 --> 00:01:10.379
♫ Where lands are green
and skies are blue ♫

00:01:13.440 --> 00:01:14.933
ROCKET
We'll all fly away together...

00:01:16.819 --> 00:01:17.760
One last time...

00:01:17.810 --> 00:01:20.698
♫ We love the all of you ♫

00:01:20.749 --> 00:01:22.432
ROCKET
...into the forever,

00:01:23.951 --> 00:01:25.425
...and beautiful sky.

00:01:25.475 --> 00:01:29.581
♪♪

00:01:29.632 --> 00:01:35.212
GROOT
We are Groot!

00:01:35.986 --> 00:01:39.421
♪♪

00:01:39.471 --> 00:01:43.728
♫ We love the all,
the all of you ♫

00:01:43.779 --> 00:01:46.006
DRAX
And we'll kill anyone who gets in our way!

00:01:46.057 --> 00:01:46.790
PETER QUILL
No, not kill anyone.

00:01:46.841 --> 00:01:47.533
DRAX
Kill a few people.

00:01:47.584 --> 00:01:48.547
PETER QUILL
Kill no people.

00:01:48.598 --> 00:01:50.075
DRAX
Kill one guy. One stupid guy,

00:01:50.125 --> 00:01:51.192
who no one loves.

00:01:51.242 --> 00:01:52.846
PETER QUILL
Now you're just making it sad.

